  "notes": [
    "The immutable, CREATE2-deployed router has no proxy or configurable state; drains through the earlier router 0x1415e8eec45dae07e7bbdf57a88ea0a309233617 (same code path, first used after the anchor) are merged as campaign.",
    "Campaign: the primary attacker's own drains (recipient 0x3a42b17f) are listed; copycat and white-hat drains are bundled per router. Rebuilt from Etherscan v2 logs (Swap events with srcToken == dstToken, then each tx's Transfer logs) because no public Sei RPC serves this history.",
    "Each debit is valued at its hourly DefiLlama price (WETH and WBTC via ETH and BTC). Tokens with no DefiLlama price (JELLY, SBC, POPO and others) are omitted because their realisation cannot be reconstructed without Sei history."
  ]
